            "sid": "GEN 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Yawe aebele Noa ati, “Ingila mu cibwato, iwe pamo no lupwa lobe lonse pantu ninkusanga ukuba umololoke muli ino nkulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.11.1+LEV.11.2+LEV.11.3+LEV.11.4+LEV.11.5+LEV.11.6+LEV.11.7+LEV.11.8+LEV.11.9+LEV.11.10+LEV.11.11+LEV.11.12+LEV.11.13+LEV.11.14+LEV.11.15+LEV.11.16+LEV.11.17+LEV.11.18+LEV.11.19+LEV.11.20+LEV.11.21+LEV.11.22+LEV.11.23+LEV.11.24+LEV.11.25+LEV.11.26+LEV.11.27+LEV.11.28+LEV.11.29+LEV.11.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 11:1-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa nama ishishakowela ubuule pali cila musango washiko ishilume cine lubali ne shikota nasho cine lubali. Pa nama ishakowela ubuule pali cila musango washiko inama shibili, iyilume ne ikota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili pa misango yonse iya fyuni, ubuule pali cila musango wafiko ifilume cine lubali ne fikota cine lubali. Uli nokucita ifi pakufisunga ifituntulu cila musango wafiko pesonde lyonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwashala inshiku cine lubali elyo nkalokesha imfula pesonde pa nshiku amakumi yane, ikalaloka akasuba no bushiku. Efyo nkonaula ifintu fyonse mpanga yonse pano isonde ifyo nabumbile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Noa acitile fyonse ifyo Yawe amukonkomeshe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noa ali ne myaka imyanda mutanda (600) ilyo ilyeshi lyaishile pesonde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.24.28+MAT.24.29+MAT.24.30+MAT.24.31+MAT.24.32+MAT.24.33+MAT.24.34+MAT.24.35+MAT.24.36+MAT.24.37+MAT.24.38+MAT.24.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mateo 24:28-39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.17.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 17:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noa, abana bakwe abaume, umukashi wakwe na bakashi ba bana bakwe baingile mu cibwato pakupusuka ku menshi ye lyeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inama shibili shibili ishishakowela ne shakowela, ifyuni ne fikulaika pa mushili fibili fibili mu musango wafiko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "icilume ne cikota, fyaisa kuli Noa, fyaingila mu cibwato ngefyo Lesa akonkomeshe Noa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili panuma ya nshiku cine lubali (17) ne lyeshi lyaisa pesonde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
